msgstr "Cima iziGuquguquki zeTempleyiti"

#: templates.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Delete the following Metrics.  Notice: If there are no other Metrics left after this process, the Report Template will be locked automatically."
msgstr "Cofa u-'Qhubeka' ukuze uCime ezi Metrikhi zilandelayo.  Qaphela: Ukuba akukho zimbi iiMetrikhi eziseleyo emva kwale nkqubo, iTempleyiti yeNgxelo iya kutshixwa ngokuzenzekelayo."

