msgid "No Variables Found"
msgstr "Akukho Ziguquguquki Zifunyenweyo"

#: templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "Variable Configuration [ edit: %s ]"
msgstr "Ulungiselelo lweSiguquguquki [ hlela: %s ]"

#: templates.php
msgid "Variable Configuration [new]"
msgstr "Ulungiselelo lweSiguquguquki [entsha]"

#: templates.php
msgid "Internal name"
msgstr "Igama langaphakathi"

#: templates.php
msgid "A unique identifier which will be created by ReportIt itself. Use this ID within the definition of your calculation formulas to include that value the report user has defined individually for it."
msgstr "Isazisi esisodwa esiya kuyilwa yi-ReportIt ngokwayo. Sebenzisa le ID kwinkcazo yeefomyula zakho zokubala ukufaka elo xabiso umsebenzisi wengxelo alichaze ngokwakhe kuyo."

#: templates.php
msgid "A name like \"Threshold\" for example which should be used as a headline within the report config."
msgstr "Igama elinjengelithi \"Umda\" umzekelo elimele lisetyenziswe njengesihloko kuqwalaselo lwengxelo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Provide a name for this Variable"
msgstr "Nika igama lale variable"

#: templates.php
msgid "A description that explains the sense of this variable."
msgstr "Inkcazelo echaza intsingiselo yolu phawu oluguquguqukayo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Provide a meaningful description"
msgstr "Nika inkcazelo enentsingiselo"

#: templates.php
msgid "Maximum Value"
msgstr "Elona Xabiso liPhezulu"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines the upper limit of this variable."
msgstr "Ichaza umda ophezulu wesi siguquguquki."

#: templates.php
msgid "Minimum Value"
msgstr "Ixabiso eliNcinci"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines the lower limit of this variable."
msgstr "Ichaza umda ongezantsi wesi siguquguquki."

#: templates.php
msgid "Default Value"
msgstr "Ixabiso elingagqibekanga"

#: templates.php
msgid "Sets the default value."
msgstr "Iseta ixabiso elisisekelo."

#: templates.php view.php
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo"

#: templates.php
msgid "The method the report owner should use to define this variable."
msgstr "Indlela umnini wengxelo ekufuneka ayisebenzise ukuchaza esi siguquki."

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines the distance between two values if method \"DropDown\" has been chosen. Please ensure that this value is not set too low, because it defines indirectly the number of options the dropdown field will have. For example the following parameters: MAX:100, MIN:0, STEP:0.01  will result in a select box of 10.001 options. This can cause dramatical performance issues due to a high CPU load at the clients side. Try to keep it under 1000."
msgstr "Ichaza umgama phakathi kwamaxabiso amabini ukuba kukhethwe indlela ye-\"DropDown\". Nceda uqinisekise ukuba eli xabiso alimiselwanga phantsi kakhulu, kuba lichaza ngokungathanga ngqo inani leenketho eliya kuba nalo ibhokisi yokwehla. Umzekelo ezi parameter zilandelayo: MAX:100, MIN:0, STEP:0.01 ziya kubangela ibhokisi yokukhetha eneenketho ezingama-10.001. Oku kunokubangela iingxaki ezinkulu zokusebenza ngenxa yomthwalo ophezulu we-CPU kwicala lomxhasi. Zama ukuligcina lingaphantsi kwe-1000."

#: templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "Metric Configuration [ edit: %s - %s ]"
msgstr "Uqwalaselo lweMetrikhi [ hlela: %s - %s ]"

#: templates.php
msgid "Metric Configuration [new]"
msgstr "Uqwalaselo lweMetrikhi [entsha]"

#: templates.php
msgid "The explanation given to this measurand. This will be shown as legend within exports as well as a tooltip within the presentation of a report itself."
msgstr "Ingcaciso enikwe lo mlinganiselo. Oku kuya kuboniswa njengesalathisi kwiifayile ezithunyelwa ngaphandle kunye nencazelo evelayo kwinkcazo yengxelo ngokwayo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Define a unique abbreviation for this measurand with max. 8 letters/numbers."
msgstr "Chaza isishunqulelo esisodwa salo mlinganiswa esinobuninzi boonobumba/amanani ayi-8."

#: templates.php
msgid "The unit given to this measurand. e.g. 'Bits/s'"
msgstr "Iyunithi enikwe lo mlinganiselo. umz. 'Bits/s'"

#: templates.php
msgid "Consolidation function"
msgstr "Umsebenzi wokudibanisa"

#: templates.php
msgid "The name of the consolidation function to define which CDPs should be read out."
msgstr "Igama lomsebenzi wokudibanisa ukuchaza ukuba zeziphi ii-CDPs ezifanele ukufundwa."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand should be become part of the final report output. Leave it unflagged if this measurands will only be used as an auxiliary calculation."
msgstr "Khetha u-'enable' ukuba lo mlinganiswa ufanele ube yinxalenye yesiphumo sengxelo yokugqibela. Yishiye ingaphawulwanga ukuba lo mlinganiswa uya kusetyenziswa kuphela njengobalo olincedisayo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand will only have one result in total instead of one for every Data Source Item. It's result<br>will be shown separately. Use this option in combination with \"Visible\" = \"off\" if you are looking for a measurand keeping an interim result only that should be reused within the calculation of other measurands without being visible for end users."
msgstr "Khetha u-'enable' ukuba lo mlinganiswa uya kuba nesiphumo esinye kuphela xa uwonke endaweni yesinye kwiNto yoMthombo weDatha nganye. Isiphumo sawo<br>siya kuboniswa ngokwahlukileyo. Sebenzisa le ndlela kunye no-\"Visible\" = \"off\" ukuba ukhangela umlinganiswa ogcina isiphumo sethutyana kuphela esifanele siphinde sisetyenziswe kubalo lweminye imilinganiswa ngaphandle kokubonakala kubasebenzisi bokugqibela."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formatting"
msgstr "Ukufomatha"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines as what type the data should be treated as."
msgstr "Ichaza ukuba idatha kufuneka iphathwe njengoluphi uhlobo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Precision"
msgstr "Ukuchaneka"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines how many decimal digits should be displayed for floating-point numbers."
msgstr "Ichaza ukuba mangaphi amanani edesimali ekufuneka aboniswe kumanani e-floating-point."

#: templates.php
msgid "Prefixes"
msgstr "Izimaphambili"

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose the type of prefix being used to format the result. With the use of decimal prefixes '1024' will be formatted to '1.024k' while the binary prefixes option returns '1ki'. Select 'off' to display the raw data, here '1024'."
msgstr "Khetha uhlobo lwesimaphambili esisetyenziswayo ukufomatha isiphumo. Ngokusetyenziswa kwezimaphambili zedesimali '1024' iya kufomathwa ibe ngu-'1.024k' ngelixa ukhetho lwezimaphambili zebhayinari lubuyisela u-'1ki'. Khetha u-'off' ukubonisa idatha ekrwada, apha ngu-'1024'."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "Ifomyula"

#: templates.php
msgid "The mathematical definition of this measurand. Allowed are all combinations of operators and operands listed below following the rules of mathematics. Use round and square brackets to signify complex terms and the order of operations."
msgstr "Inkcazo yemathematika yalo mlinganiselo. Zivumelekile zonke iindibaniselwano zabaqhubi kunye namanani asetyenziswayo adweliswe ngezantsi ngokulandela imithetho yemathematika. Sebenzisa izibiyeli ezirawundi nezisikwere ukubonisa amabinzana antsonkothileyo kunye nolandelelwano lwemisebenzi."

#: templates.php
msgid "Operators & Operands"
msgstr "Iioparetha kunye nee-Operandi"

#: templates.php
msgid "Click on one of the listed operators or operand to append them to your calucalion formula. The tooltip will show you additional information like description, return value, arguments and usage."
msgstr "Cofa komnye wabaqhubi okanye ii-operand ezidwelisiweyo ukuze uzifake kwifomula yakho yokubala. Incam yesixhobo iya kukubonisa ulwazi olongezelelweyo olufana nenkcazelo, ixabiso elibuyisiweyo, ii-argument kunye nosetyenziso."

